y/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6bbf3d5c-7315-598c-a705-59edaee54071"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6bbf3d5c-7315-598c-a705-59edaee54071" :answer-field/id #uuid "6bbf3d5c-7315-598c-a705-59edaee54071" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f030ff6e-a3ae-530a-8c00-7db23ecb2bab" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f030ff6e-a3ae-530a-8c00-7db23ecb2bab" "answer-e4db4752-6564-5c8e-a4b2-5e33070c0ccf" "answer-3f712fe7-c921-55cf-8be6-689ccf2321e5" "answer-7d2d0983-60c7-591b-b0c4-4e918aaf9e11" "answer-eddd68a6-ec62-5717-a1b3-78a728a51d44"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f030ff6e-a3ae-530a-8c00-7db23ecb2bab" :answer/id #uuid "f030ff6e-a3ae-530a-8c00-7db23ecb2bab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e4db4752-6564-5c8e-a4b2-5e33070c0ccf" :answer/id #uuid "e4db4752-6564-5c8e-a4b2-5e33070c0ccf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f712fe7-c921-55cf-8be6-689ccf2321e5" :answer/id #uuid "3f712fe7-c921-55cf-8be6-689ccf2321e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7d2d0983-60c7-591b-b0c4-4e918aaf9e11" :answer/id #uuid "7d2d0983-60c7-591b-b0c4-4e918aaf9e11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eddd68a6-ec62-5717-a1b3-78a728a51d44" :answer/id #uuid "eddd68a6-ec62-5717-a1b3-78a728a51d44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f3715793-c326-5ff1-9566-caa835ab04e3" :question/id #uuid "f3715793-c326-5ff1-9566-caa835ab04e3" :question/math-academy-id "q-60032" :question/problem "The following table shows the number of days it rained in Madrid during $2019.$\n\n| Rainy days | No-rain days |\n| --- | --- |\n| $63$ | $302$ |\n\nRounding to the nearest ten, determine the approximate ratio of the number of days it rained in Madrid to the number of days it did not rain." :question/worked-solution "First, let's approximate the number of days that it rained and did not rain by rounding to the nearest $10$:\n\n- Rainy days: $63⟶60$\n\n- No-rain days: $302⟶300$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of days that it rained to the number of days that it did not rain is approximately:\n\n$$\n\\frac{60}{300}\n$$\n\nWe can simplify this ratio by dividing both numbers by $10$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{60÷10}{300÷10}=\\frac{6}{30}\n$$\n\nThen, we divide by $6$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6÷6}{30÷6}=\\frac{1}{5}\n$$\n\nHence, the ratio of the number of days that it rained and did not rain is approximately $1:5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-61576f24-7cb4-5c5a-89ff-ff9df4f9e64d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-61576f24-7cb4-5c5a-89ff-ff9df4f9e64d" :answer-field/id #uuid "61576f24-7cb4-5c5a-89ff-ff9df4f9e64d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-0ff3556e-168c-55d0-8372-45f266865a77" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b018535e-0eac-575e-b718-7cca5302b75a" "answer-0ff3556e-168c-55d0-8372-45f266865a77" "answer-53c5c875-0b9d-597d-a611-64fcdaa2bd77" "answer-a51a42ac-bdf0-5461-8257-96255afc9426" "answer-aa90b4a8-7b54-56d7-810c-e59e85b4f1af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b018535e-0eac-575e-b718-7cca5302b75a" :answer/id #uuid "b018535e-0eac-575e-b718-7cca5302b75a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1:4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ff3556e-168c-55d0-8372-45f266865a77" :answer/id #uuid "0ff3556e-168c-55d0-8372-45f266865a77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1:5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-53c5c875-0b9d-597d-a611-64fcdaa2bd77" :answer/id #uuid "53c5c875-0b9d-597d-a611-64fcdaa2bd77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answ