 dividing both numbers by $100$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1\\,200÷100}{1\\,600÷100}=\\frac{12}{16}\n$$\n\nThen, we divide by $4$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{12÷4}{16÷4}=\\frac{3}{4}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the weight of sand to the weight of the crushed stone is approximately $\\frac{3}{4}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c0b993e3-c224-5545-b5e6-d24529a54d7d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c0b993e3-c224-5545-b5e6-d24529a54d7d" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0b993e3-c224-5545-b5e6-d24529a54d7d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-44d44b2c-7f46-5763-94a1-bf4f8891647f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fd5df837-22b0-59c0-8ce1-0784e2b5404b" "answer-693daa38-3e49-587a-b9f1-8ece9b7b15ad" "answer-44d44b2c-7f46-5763-94a1-bf4f8891647f" "answer-e12db9f4-426d-50c6-ad4d-5f29c41b8f5b" "answer-deb830c9-bdf2-5924-b45c-bf8c221b5a36"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fd5df837-22b0-59c0-8ce1-0784e2b5404b" :answer/id #uuid "fd5df837-22b0-59c0-8ce1-0784e2b5404b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-693daa38-3e49-587a-b9f1-8ece9b7b15ad" :answer/id #uuid "693daa38-3e49-587a-b9f1-8ece9b7b15ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-44d44b2c-7f46-5763-94a1-bf4f8891647f" :answer/id #uuid "44d44b2c-7f46-5763-94a1-bf4f8891647f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e12db9f4-426d-50c6-ad4d-5f29c41b8f5b" :answer/id #uuid "e12db9f4-426d-50c6-ad4d-5f29c41b8f5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-deb830c9-bdf2-5924-b45c-bf8c221b5a36" :answer/id #uuid "deb830c9-bdf2-5924-b45c-bf8c221b5a36" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1c338986-28f6-5449-8d51-483994f85450" :question/id #uuid "1c338986-28f6-5449-8d51-483994f85450" :question/math-academy-id "q-59842" :question/problem "An election took place in a small town between two political parties, The Green Party and The Labour Party. The table below shows the total number of votes that each party received.\n\n| The Green Party | The Labour Party |\n| --- | --- |\n| $1\\,020$ | $3\\,022$ |\n\nBy rounding to the nearest hundred, find the approximate ratio of Labour Party votes to total votes." :question/worked-solution "First, let's approximate the total number of votes that each party received by rounding to the nearest hundred.\n\n- The Green Party: $1\\,020⟶1\\,000$\n\n- The Labour Party: $3\\,022⟶3\\,000$\n\nSo the total number of votes received was approximately $1\\,000+3\\,000=4\\,000.$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of Labour Party votes to total votes (expressed as a fraction) is approximately\n\n$$\n\\frac{3\\,000}{4\\,000}.\n$$\n\nDividing the numerator and denominator by $1\\,000$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{3\\,000÷1\\,000}{4\\,000÷1\\,000}=\\frac{3}{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of Labour Party votes to total votes is approximately $\\frac{3}{4}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e25fd75f-c1a2-5fc4-925b-ca242e652588"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e25fd75f-c1a2-5fc4-925b-ca242e652588" :answer-field/id #uuid "e25fd75f-c1a2-5fc4-925b-ca242e652588" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7ed51ed6-e5d1-59f3-b219-2cccee1d206f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-420b707b-b03d-50d7-88ac-8059253f50ae" "answer-c2bff906-5002-50a8-9291-2c2ce6a14cfa" "answer-3a82c760-70ad-50c5-bb52-457921085692" "answer-123f12c1-4c10-571e-b530-002c202c07c6" "answer-7ed51ed6-e5d1-59f3-b219-2cccee1d206f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-420b707b-b03d-50d7-88ac-8059253f50ae" :answer/id #uuid "420b707