ight of the wheat flour to the weight of the mix of wheat flour and sugar is approximately $\\frac{3}{5}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-111a1315-8eca-5a55-9589-e07c401c9a1d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-111a1315-8eca-5a55-9589-e07c401c9a1d" :answer-field/id #uuid "111a1315-8eca-5a55-9589-e07c401c9a1d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6530dce8-07a2-52b2-bab7-87b30045d656" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f705e8b6-83b9-5492-aea8-cbffaba253af" "answer-adc9b931-87e3-5613-8fff-ad2dd92bfe02" "answer-6530dce8-07a2-52b2-bab7-87b30045d656" "answer-ab1ab197-5663-5877-b460-3a40bacba954" "answer-eff98b36-4279-51e6-b969-4cc21ecd61ee"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f705e8b6-83b9-5492-aea8-cbffaba253af" :answer/id #uuid "f705e8b6-83b9-5492-aea8-cbffaba253af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-adc9b931-87e3-5613-8fff-ad2dd92bfe02" :answer/id #uuid "adc9b931-87e3-5613-8fff-ad2dd92bfe02" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6530dce8-07a2-52b2-bab7-87b30045d656" :answer/id #uuid "6530dce8-07a2-52b2-bab7-87b30045d656" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ab1ab197-5663-5877-b460-3a40bacba954" :answer/id #uuid "ab1ab197-5663-5877-b460-3a40bacba954" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eff98b36-4279-51e6-b969-4cc21ecd61ee" :answer/id #uuid "eff98b36-4279-51e6-b969-4cc21ecd61ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-b48042cf-85c0-5d86-9405-062b1a5605f0" :question/id #uuid "b48042cf-85c0-5d86-9405-062b1a5605f0" :question/math-academy-id "q-60005" :question/problem "The following table shows the number of boys and girls at Lincoln High School.\n\n| Boys | Girls |\n| --- | --- |\n| $331$ | $457$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nRounding to the nearest hundred, determine the approximate ratio of the number of girls to the number of boys." :question/worked-solution "First, let's approximate the number of boys and girls by rounding to the nearest hundred.\n\n- Boys: $331⟶300$\n\n- Girls: $457⟶500$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of girls to the number of boys is approximately\n\n$$\n\\frac{500}{300}.\n$$\n\nDividing the numerator and denominator by $100$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{500÷100}{300÷100}=\\frac{5}{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the ratio of the number of girls to the number of boys is approximately $\\frac{5}{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ca9008f6-427a-5c15-b3e3-f084de5c9a74"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ca9008f6-427a-5c15-b3e3-f084de5c9a74" :answer-field/id #uuid "ca9008f6-427a-5c15-b3e3-f084de5c9a74" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5bc36dd0-9168-579b-9067-9cfcb3b2d7b9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f155c864-ac17-5346-9dc2-5df53d5d556d" "answer-4586244a-c02e-5cc3-9a78-31c9a9ced0c5" "answer-3bef2452-75c6-5875-aadc-4b65541d1a31" "answer-78da7013-d6f3-530e-9373-2c6eb6bfa826" "answer-5bc36dd0-9168-579b-9067-9cfcb3b2d7b9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f155c864-ac17-5346-9dc2-5df53d5d556d" :answer/id #uuid "f155c864-ac17-5346-9dc2-5df53d5d556d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4586244a-c02e-5cc3-9a78-31c9a9ced0c5" :answer/id #uuid "4586244a-c02e-5cc3-9a78-31c9a9ced0c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3bef2452-75c6-5875-aadc-4b65541d1a31" :answer/id #uuid "3bef2452-75c6-5875-aadc-4b65541d1a31" :answer/type :answer.type/math :ans