e approximately $200$ girls in Eastwood High School." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2b02d1c9-ff7f-5adc-bdd5-37b6db70e37e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2b02d1c9-ff7f-5adc-bdd5-37b6db70e37e" :answer-field/id #uuid "2b02d1c9-ff7f-5adc-bdd5-37b6db70e37e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7e24de99-73f2-5734-a999-e16171397584" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c2ed6cdb-443d-5476-82ff-7f8b4e155faf" "answer-7e24de99-73f2-5734-a999-e16171397584" "answer-fd56626a-a3ea-50f6-a3e4-b9f09a5eb53f" "answer-ac534f52-7476-5be3-a254-54aa878ca486" "answer-b7ea3a5f-0c04-56de-a14c-7ac6703fa76c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c2ed6cdb-443d-5476-82ff-7f8b4e155faf" :answer/id #uuid "c2ed6cdb-443d-5476-82ff-7f8b4e155faf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$190$ girls" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7e24de99-73f2-5734-a999-e16171397584" :answer/id #uuid "7e24de99-73f2-5734-a999-e16171397584" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$200$ girls" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fd56626a-a3ea-50f6-a3e4-b9f09a5eb53f" :answer/id #uuid "fd56626a-a3ea-50f6-a3e4-b9f09a5eb53f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$210$ girls" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac534f52-7476-5be3-a254-54aa878ca486" :answer/id #uuid "ac534f52-7476-5be3-a254-54aa878ca486" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$220$ girls" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b7ea3a5f-0c04-56de-a14c-7ac6703fa76c" :answer/id #uuid "b7ea3a5f-0c04-56de-a14c-7ac6703fa76c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$230$ girls" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-989f692a-e9cc-5d93-9c14-352947770c60" :question/id #uuid "989f692a-e9cc-5d93-9c14-352947770c60" :question/math-academy-id "q-364167" :question/problem "Emma and Noah get paid for mowing lawns. The ratio of Emma's reward to Noah's reward is $7:3.$ \nDuring a particular week, Noah received $$1215.$ By rounding Noah's earnings to the nearest hundred, approximate the amount of money that Emma received." :question/worked-solution "First, let's approximate the amount of money that Noah received:\n\n$$\n$1215⟶$1200\n$$\n\nThe ratio of Emma's earnings to Noah's earnings is\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{3}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe numerator represents Emma's earnings  and the denominator represents Noah's earnings.\n\nWe can make a denominator of $1200$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by \n $400$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7\\times 400}{3\\times 400}=\\frac{2800}{1200}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, Emma received approximately $$2800.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a53fabe5-f69e-5ef4-b936-049629805ba8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a53fabe5-f69e-5ef4-b936-049629805ba8" :answer-field/id #uuid "a53fabe5-f69e-5ef4-b936-049629805ba8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-07503364-4d4e-57d2-bb77-f0ad9574a985" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d6107588-030a-56f4-a9d0-e0374535cf03" "answer-c0385104-a86b-5617-b3aa-b06b49ab6b02" "answer-07503364-4d4e-57d2-bb77-f0ad9574a985" "answer-d6915496-7a5c-57b9-8639-75286d6bd22d" "answer-b59ff6dc-d30e-5cd3-9cd5-ee41c27ed72b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d6107588-030a-56f4-a9d0-e0374535cf03" :answer/id #uuid "d6107588-030a-56f4-a9d0-e0374535cf03" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$2100$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c0385104-a86b-5617-b3aa-b06b49ab6b02" :answer/id #uuid "c0385104-a86b-5617-b3aa-b06b49ab6b02" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$2400$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-07503364-4d4e-57d2-bb77-f0ad9574a985" :answer/id #uuid "07503364-4d4e-57d2-bb77-f0ad9574a985" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$2800$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d6915496-7a5c-57b9-8639-75286d6bd22d" :answer/id #uuid "d6915496-7a5c-57b9-8639-75286d6bd22d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$3000$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b59ff6dc-d30e-5cd3-9cd5-ee41c27ed72b" :answer/id #uuid "b59ff6dc-d30e-5cd3-9cd5-ee41c27ed72b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$$3200$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-84690951-1e12-55e6-b7b2-8d0eed282ba4" :question/id #uuid "84690951-1e12-55e6-b7b2-8d0eed282ba4" :question/math-academy-id "q-364191" :question/problem "Rachel and Tomas work at a bakery. The ratio of Rachel's sales to Tomas's sales is $7:9.$ \nDuring a particular week, Tomas completed $912$ sales. By rounding Tomas's sales to the nearest hundred, approximate the number of sales that Rachel completed." :question/worked-solution "First, let's approximate the number of sales that Tomas completed:\n\n$$\n912⟶900\n$$\n\nThe ratio of Rachel's sales to Tomas's sales is\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{9}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe numerator represents Rachel's sales  and the denominator represents Tomas's sales.\n\nWe can make a denominator of $900$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by \n $100$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7\\times 100}{9\\times 100}=\\frac{700}{900}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, Rachel completed approximately $700$ sales." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d03d358e-d42f-50ba-bc16-660786f0e0c8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d03d358e-d42f-50ba-bc16-660786f0e0c8" :answer-field/id #uuid "d03d358e-d42f-50ba-bc16-660786f0e0c8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-13ed95b8-32f9-5781-9f81-9678fab31222" :answer-field/choices ["answer-228894c5-7c4f-5cbd-893c-1456fbd83512" "answer-b388ad8f-2935-5568-b7d3-67afea27f938" "answer-13ed95b8-32f9-5781-9f81-9678fab31222" "answer-d96adcf7-b0f9-598f-96ca-ace9fa2193d4" "answer-6f8e2cc9-3cae-5add-8f8d-e7298ffdb233"] :db/ensu